# In the Mood for Love (jeuno 69): finishes outside their state. A level 75 Warrior, the quest accepted (a GM), a
# Chameleon Diamond. 10036 open, the quest set available by a GM: no 10036 finish there: nothing (no gil, the diamond
# kept, no Option). Completed with Option 1 (a GM): Matoaka's 10039 open, the quest set available by a GM (not
# accepted: addQuest over a completed quest keeps the completed bit, so the completed finish would run): no 10039 finish
# in the available state: nothing. Then completed again (a GM): 10039 twice (Option 1 reset between), the second talk
# shows the quest's progressEvent against her shop (the fallback an event would alternate to).
lists LowerJeuno/Odasel/onTrade LowerJeuno/Matoaka/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10036 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10039
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-56.9,-6,-111.7 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
quest Jeuno.InTheMoodForLove accepted
item ChameleonDiamond
login
trade Odasel ChameleonDiamond x1        # 10036
quest Jeuno.InTheMoodForLove available  # a GM, while 10036 is open
finish                                  # nothing
quest Jeuno.InTheMoodForLove completed  # a GM
charvar Quest[3][69]Option 1            # a GM
warp -35.7,-6.1,-121.9 LowerJeuno       # by Matoaka
trigger Matoaka                         # 10039
quest Jeuno.InTheMoodForLove available  # a GM, while 10039 is open
finish                                  # no 10039 finish in the available state: nothing
quest Jeuno.InTheMoodForLove completed  # a GM: the completed state again (Option 1 kept)
trigger Matoaka                         # 10039 (P) against her shop (her onTrigger is the fallback)
finish                                  # the 10039 finish: Option 0
charvar Quest[3][69]Option 1            # a GM
trigger Matoaka                         # 10039 again: a progressEvent ties the shop, an event would alternate to the shop
finish
